            "value": "De assistent kan je gezondheidsdossier lezen. Hij kan niets wijzigen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant hasn't learned anything about you yet. As you chat, facts it picks up will show here — and you can forget any of them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Assistent hat noch nichts über dich gelernt. Während du chattest, erscheinen hier die Fakten, die er aufschnappt, und du kannst jeden davon vergessen lassen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The assistant hasn't learned anything about you yet. As you chat, facts it picks up will show here, and you can forget any of them."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De assistent heeft nog niets over je geleerd. Terwijl je chat, verschijnen hier de feiten die hij oppikt, en je kunt hem elk ervan laten vergeten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant stops answering until you enter a key again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Assistent antwortet erst wieder, wenn du einen Schlüssel einträgst."
