            "value": "De bot is geblokkeerd in Telegram."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The change stayed smaller than this score's own margin of variation, so it is not reported as a change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Veränderung blieb kleiner als die übliche Schwankungsbreite dieses Werts und wird deshalb nicht als Veränderung gemeldet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The change stayed smaller than this score's own margin of variation, so it is not reported as a change."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De verandering bleef kleiner dan de gebruikelijke schommeling van deze score, dus wordt ze niet als verandering gemeld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The doctor will lose access immediately. This can't be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Arzt verliert sofort den Zugriff. Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."
          }
