            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het medicijn dat je als ingenomen wilt markeren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pillars behind this score were chosen by you.": {
      "comment": "Health Score a11y — spoken form of the provenance mark",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Säulen hinter diesem Wert hast du selbst gewählt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pillars behind this score were chosen by you."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De pijlers achter deze score heb je zelf gekozen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rest of your dashboard is up to date. This part didn't load — please try again.": {
      "comment": "#67 — Home metrics section error state message; reassures the other sections loaded.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Rest deines Dashboards ist aktuell. Dieser Teil wurde nicht geladen. Bitte versuch es erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rest of your dashboard is up to date. This part didn't load. Please try again."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De rest van je overzicht is bijgewerkt. Dit deel is niet geladen. Probeer het opnieuw."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server bundle follows the selection you save in the doctor report. Save one there first, then generate again.": {
      "comment": "CU-13 — the unified sharing surface: server $everything came back empty because no report selection was ever saved",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Server-Bundle folgt der Auswahl, die du im Gesundheitsbericht speicherst. Speichere dort zuerst eine Auswahl und erzeuge das Bundle dann erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server bundle follows the selection you save in the doctor report. Save one there first, then generate again."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De serverbundel volgt de selectie die je in het artsenrapport bewaart. Bewaar daar eerst een selectie en genereer daarna opnieuw."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server didn't accept this. Please check your entry and try again.": {
      "comment": "Error banner — the server refused the request with a stated reason the calling surface did not handle itself",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Server hat das nicht angenommen. Prüf deine Eingabe und versuch es erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server didn't accept this. Please check your entry and try again."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De server heeft dit niet geaccepteerd. Controleer je invoer en probeer het opnieuw."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The upper (systolic) value in mmHg.": {
      "comment": "v0.7.1 W-APPINTENTS — Siri / Shortcuts intent strings (Log BG / Log BP / Mark medication taken).",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der obere (systolische) Wert in mmHg."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The upper (systolic) value in mmHg."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De bovenste (systolische) waarde in mmHg."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The way this score is calculated changed. Any step you see is a change in the method, not a change in you — so this week is not compared with the last one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Rechenweise dieses Werts hat sich geändert. Ein Sprung liegt an der Messmethode, nicht an dir. Deshalb wird diese Woche nicht mit der letzten verglichen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The way this score is calculated changed. Any step you see is a change in the method, not a change in you. So this week is not compared with the last one."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De manier waarop deze score wordt berekend, is veranderd. Een sprong komt door de nieuwe methode, niet door jou. Daarom wordt deze week niet met de vorige vergeleken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no current value to compare.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es gibt keinen aktuellen Wert zum Vergleichen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no current value to compare."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er is geen actuele waarde om mee te vergelijken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no previous week to compare against.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es gibt keine Vorwoche zum Vergleichen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no previous week to compare against."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er is geen vorige week om mee te vergelijken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are alerts your device produced using its own built-in detection. They are shown here for your awareness only. This is not a medical assessment by HealthLog, and HealthLog does not diagnose any condition. If a notification concerns you, talk to your doctor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies sind Hinweise, die dein Gerät mit seiner eigenen integrierten Erkennung erzeugt hat. Sie werden hier nur zu deiner Information angezeigt. Dies ist keine medizinische Bewertung durch HealthLog, und HealthLog stellt keine Diagnose. Wenn dich ein Hinweis beunruhigt, sprich mit deiner Ärztin oder deinem Arzt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are alerts your device produced using its own built-in detection. They are shown here for your awareness only. This is not a medical assessment by HealthLog, and HealthLog does not diagnose any condition. If a notification concerns you, talk to your doctor."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit zijn meldingen die je apparaat zelf heeft gegeven met zijn ingebouwde detectie. Ze worden hier alleen ter informatie getoond. Dit is geen medische beoordeling door HealthLog, en HealthLog stelt geen diagnoses. Maak je je zorgen over een melding, praat dan met je arts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are facts the assistant has picked up about you. Swipe to forget any of them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das sind Fakten, die der Assistent über dich aufgeschnappt hat. Wische, um einen davon vergessen zu lassen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are facts the assistant has picked up about you. Swipe to forget any of them."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit zijn feiten die de assistent over je heeft opgepikt. Veeg om er een te laten vergeten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These conversations are kept on your server. Open one to read it back — the coach remembers them across your devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Unterhaltungen liegen auf deinem Server. Öffne eine, um sie nachzulesen. Der Coach merkt sie sich geräteübergreifend."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These conversations are kept on your server. Open one to read it back. The coach remembers them across your devices."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze gesprekken worden op je server bewaard. Open er een om het terug te lezen. De coach onthoudt ze op al je apparaten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This action cannot be undone.": {
      "comment": "PB3 — SettingsAdvancedScreen Danger-Zone card footer",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
