          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes it from your server on all devices. This can't be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie wird auf deinem Server für alle Geräte entfernt. Das lässt sich nicht rückgängig machen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes it from your server on all devices. This can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hiermee wordt het op al je apparaten van je server verwijderd. Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This selection contains no pillar that is physically measured. Without a measurement taken on your body the number would only summarise what you record about yourself, so keep at least one measured pillar in the selection.": {
      "comment": "Health Score composition refused — no measured physiological pillar",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Auswahl enthält keine körperlich gemessene Säule. Ohne eine Messung an deinem Körper wäre die Zahl nur eine Zusammenfassung dessen, was du über dich einträgst. Lass deshalb mindestens eine gemessene Säule in der Auswahl."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This selection contains no pillar that is physically measured. Without a measurement taken on your body the number would only summarise what you record about yourself, so keep at least one measured pillar in the selection."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze selectie bevat geen pijler die lichamelijk wordt gemeten. Zonder een meting aan je lichaam zou het getal alleen samenvatten wat je zelf over jezelf vastlegt. Houd dus minstens één gemeten pijler in de selectie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This selection covers fewer than three different areas of health. A composite built from one or two areas would not be an overall score, only that one area under another name — and several pillars can describe the same area, in which case they count together as one.": {
      "comment": "Health Score composition refused — too few distinct health domains",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Auswahl deckt weniger als drei verschiedene Gesundheitsbereiche ab. Eine Gesamtzahl aus einem oder zwei Bereichen wäre kein Gesundheitswert, sondern nur dieser eine Bereich unter anderem Namen. Außerdem können mehrere Säulen denselben Bereich beschreiben und zählen dann zusammen als einer."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This selection covers fewer than three different areas of health. A composite built from one or two areas would not be an overall score, only that one area under another name. Also, several pillars can describe the same area, in which case they count together as one."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze selectie beslaat minder dan drie verschillende gezondheidsgebieden. Een samengestelde score uit één of twee gebieden is geen totaalscore, maar alleen dat ene gebied onder een andere naam. Ook kunnen meerdere pijlers hetzelfde gebied beschrijven; ze tellen dan samen als één."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server does not appear to be a HealthLog server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Server scheint kein HealthLog-Server zu sein."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This server does not appear to be a HealthLog server."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze server lijkt geen HealthLog-server te zijn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This update can also sync ECGs and mood from Apple Health. Allow access to turn both on.": {
      "comment": "25-01 update-notice card (decision E-2026-08-28)",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Update kann zusätzlich EKGs und Stimmung aus Apple Health synchronisieren. Erlaube den Zugriff, um beides zu aktivieren."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This update can also sync ECGs and mood from Apple Health. Allow access to turn both on."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Met deze update kun je ook ECG's en stemming uit Apple Health synchroniseren. Geef toegang om beide in te schakelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This was changed somewhere else while you were editing. Reopen the screen and make your change again.": {
