            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Pulsdruck (die Differenz zwischen deinen Werten) beträgt etwa %d mmHg. Rund 40 ist in Ruhe typisch."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pulse pressure (the gap between your readings) is about %d mmHg. Roughly 40 is typical at rest."
